    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. to be honest, i need to be more specific for my bosses. when you say nigeria/kenya might need \"more stringent oversight,\" can you expand on that? are we talking about issues with worker discipline, maybe a lack of technical aptitude, or just general unpredictability in the local infrastructure/culture? basically, if we choose Africa over Eastern Europe, what are the actual \"on-the-ground\" risks regarding the workers themselves? just need the unvarnished version for the risk matrix.",
